  "setup": "Head also needs original deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash shards 47+48 + index + config.json (~190 GiB, native FP8 Engram tables) mounted at /engram-src. Worker gets weights via NFSv4 export from head (default WEIGHT_SYNC=nfs; zfs/rsync alternatives). CX7 RoCE link with per-node NIC/HCA pins (head enp1s0f1np1/rocep1s0f1, worker enp1s0f0np0/rocep1s0f0). start.sh bind-mounts ~16 overlay patch files into /opt/dsv41 and runs them before vllm serve; runs a GPU self-check container first. Optional ./start.sh pack writes per-rank Engram shards to local NVMe (+25-50% prefill).",
